WEBVTT

01:33.741 --> 01:35.910
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.981 --> 01:38.110
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.181 --> 01:40.881
(Episode 20)

01:41.750 --> 01:42.780
Dr. Xu.

01:43.151 --> 01:45.050
What a coincidence to run into you here.

01:45.491 --> 01:46.291
What a coincidence.

01:48.121 --> 01:48.920
It's quite a coincidence.

01:49.121 --> 01:50.321
Are you out shopping too?

01:50.621 --> 01:52.660
Yes. We're running out of daily necessities,

01:52.731 --> 01:54.190
so we're replenishing them for everyone.

01:54.631 --> 01:55.860
It's about time for us to return.

01:55.931 --> 01:56.931
All right.

01:57.800 --> 01:59.231
Mr. Song, it's fine for you to be strict...

01:59.300 --> 02:00.601
with your subordinates.

02:02.201 --> 02:03.841
But a doctor's personnel relationship...

02:04.041 --> 02:04.841
stays in the hospital.

02:05.841 --> 02:07.610
She's not an employee of the fire station.

02:07.910 --> 02:09.341
The medical rescue team...

02:09.610 --> 02:11.140
is working with you in joint hands.

02:11.851 --> 02:13.050
Everyone is of equal status.

02:13.910 --> 02:14.711
So...

02:15.151 --> 02:17.321
forget about your rules...

02:17.550 --> 02:18.490
that restrict personal freedom.

02:18.650 --> 02:19.851
Let's be more humane.

02:19.990 --> 02:20.990
Yan Chen.

02:22.221 --> 02:23.120
I think...

02:24.120 --> 02:26.460
Mr. Song won't ignore...

02:26.930 --> 02:28.330
what I say, right?

02:30.501 --> 02:31.300
Of course not.

02:32.231 --> 02:33.170
Good advice...

02:33.501 --> 02:34.571
should be taken into consideration.

02:40.041 --> 02:41.210
Take your time shopping.

02:41.441 --> 02:42.210
We'll get going.

02:42.281 --> 02:43.140
Yan Chen, let's go.

02:43.441 --> 02:44.610
Didn't I tell you...

02:45.050 --> 02:46.550
to cut down on junk food?

02:47.550 --> 02:49.120
Stay away from trash.

03:10.640 --> 03:11.471
Yang Chi.

03:12.110 --> 03:13.471
- Yes. - Do you want some?

03:14.340 --> 03:16.011
- Yes. - Take it if you want some.

03:16.080 --> 03:17.041
Are you waiting for me to feed you?

03:28.420 --> 03:29.191
Let's go.

03:34.131 --> 03:35.001
Dr. Xu.

03:37.661 --> 03:39.031
Shopping time is over.

03:39.201 --> 03:40.001
It's time to return to the team.

03:42.900 --> 03:43.670
Yan Chen.

03:44.071 --> 03:45.270
I have to go back to the fire station.

03:50.140 --> 03:51.411
Isn't she on leave?

03:51.811 --> 03:53.311
I'm sorry, Mr. Meng.

03:53.951 --> 03:56.650
There's a time limit and regulations when we have outings.

04:00.191 --> 04:00.990
I'll get going.

04:08.360 --> 04:09.161
We'll give your suggestion...

04:09.860 --> 04:10.930
a consideration.

04:12.370 --> 04:13.870
- Back to work. - Yes.

04:42.061 --> 04:42.801
(Automatic parking)

04:42.861 --> 04:44.600
(Reverse parking)

04:58.951 --> 04:59.881
Hello, Mom.

05:07.621 --> 05:09.561
Give me a hint in the future for situations like this.

05:09.621 --> 05:11.090
You gave me a scare.

05:11.520 --> 05:12.590
You're just slow-witted.

05:13.390 --> 05:16.131
Why didn't you discuss

05:16.460 --> 05:18.470
about going to the fire station with the family?

05:18.871 --> 05:20.571
Mom, this is work.

05:20.830 --> 05:23.900
About what I said before,

05:24.571 --> 05:26.640
did it go in one ear and out the other?

05:27.710 --> 05:28.681
No.

05:29.511 --> 05:30.280
Remember.

05:30.710 --> 05:31.881
Come home this weekend.

05:32.681 --> 05:33.650
The eldest son of the Dong family...

05:34.251 --> 05:35.381
might come over for dinner.

05:36.681 --> 05:38.181
- Mom, can I not... - No.

05:38.251 --> 05:39.621
It's a done deal.

05:41.150 --> 05:42.121
Good night.

05:54.671 --> 05:55.600
Mom, I'm home.

05:56.270 --> 05:57.171
Have you eaten?

05:57.600 --> 05:58.270
Yes.

05:58.671 --> 05:59.671
I came back to get something.

05:59.741 --> 06:00.770
I'm going home after.

06:00.840 --> 06:01.540
Wait.

06:03.140 --> 06:04.040
Did you know...

06:04.441 --> 06:05.681
that your sister...

06:06.611 --> 06:07.511
went to the fire station?

06:11.381 --> 06:12.191
Yes.

06:13.691 --> 06:14.491
You did?

06:16.491 --> 06:17.220
If you did,

06:17.890 --> 06:19.090
why didn't you stop her?

06:20.530 --> 06:22.660
Did she get together...

06:23.131 --> 06:24.160
with Song Yan again?

06:27.571 --> 06:29.171
No, they aren't together.

06:30.171 --> 06:31.441
Meng Yan Chen,

06:32.171 --> 06:33.871
you've gone too far.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.640
You're lying to me.

06:36.241 --> 06:37.140
Last time,

06:37.340 --> 06:38.910
you paid the fine for them.

06:39.080 --> 06:39.951
This time,

06:40.150 --> 06:41.051
you hid the fact...

06:41.111 --> 06:42.650
that she was at the fire station.

06:43.321 --> 06:45.251
You're covering for her all the time.

06:45.951 --> 06:46.921
It seems like...

06:47.121 --> 06:48.861
I've given you two too much freedom...

06:48.921 --> 06:50.061
and spoiled you.

06:50.121 --> 06:52.290
All right. I'll get her another job...

06:52.390 --> 06:54.330
at a high school or pharmaceutical company.

06:54.530 --> 06:55.400
Mom.

06:55.631 --> 06:57.131
Qin Qin likes being a doctor.

06:57.631 --> 06:59.131
Let her stay in the hospital.

06:59.371 --> 07:00.030
Mom.

07:05.311 --> 07:06.470
Mr. Liu.

07:06.941 --> 07:09.140
I don't think what you're doing is appropriate.

07:09.410 --> 07:13.611
You're making young nurses and doctors...

07:13.681 --> 07:15.121
stay at the fire station.

07:17.980 --> 07:19.121
I know.

07:19.191 --> 07:20.720
It's for work.

07:21.720 --> 07:23.020
Of course I support you.

07:23.090 --> 07:25.131
But I don't think this behavior...

07:25.330 --> 07:26.361
is appropriate.

07:27.431 --> 07:29.160
Of course we have to meet.

07:29.960 --> 07:32.631
Yes, we must.

07:38.571 --> 07:40.511
We're in the transition phase.

07:40.710 --> 07:42.241
If we encounter any problems,

07:42.311 --> 07:43.340
we'll correct them in time.

07:44.441 --> 07:45.181
Yes.

07:45.251 --> 07:46.650
Thank you, Mr. Liu.

07:48.520 --> 07:49.321
What's the matter?

07:50.751 --> 07:52.451
We received a complaint from the family of a medical personnel.

07:52.520 --> 07:54.150
They want them to move out of the fire station.

07:54.621 --> 07:57.290
But they're supposed to dispatch with us.

07:59.160 --> 08:00.491
However, it's true.

08:00.561 --> 08:01.660
They work 24 hours a day...

08:01.730 --> 08:03.030
and don't know when they'll be dispatched.

08:03.261 --> 08:04.261
It's understandable.

08:04.960 --> 08:05.730
What do you think?

08:09.171 --> 08:10.571
Their demand is reasonable.

08:10.970 --> 08:11.770
It's fine for them move to out.

08:12.611 --> 08:14.011
It's already a miracle that they agreed...

08:14.071 --> 08:15.441
to be dispatched together.

08:16.210 --> 08:17.040
The doctors...

08:17.111 --> 08:18.681
aren't firefighters after all.

08:19.150 --> 08:20.580
They have their own lives too.

08:23.280 --> 08:24.980
There are only a few of them.

08:25.850 --> 08:27.890
Who could have complained?

08:33.660 --> 08:35.431
Could it be Xu Qin's mom?

08:37.061 --> 08:38.801
She seems like a ruthless woman.

08:54.110 --> 08:55.051
Hello.

09:17.401 --> 09:18.500
I was thinking...

09:18.970 --> 09:20.870
it's about time you came to see me.

09:27.710 --> 09:29.151
Is this how you were raised?

09:31.281 --> 09:32.651
Regarding our feud,

09:33.350 --> 09:34.250
you...

09:35.321 --> 09:37.490
still care about the silly name-calling?

09:37.960 --> 09:38.730
Yes.

09:40.330 --> 09:41.130
It was me.

09:42.760 --> 09:43.460
I know.

09:44.531 --> 09:45.630
Apart from you,

09:46.071 --> 09:47.201
no one would have done that.

09:48.370 --> 09:50.100
I thought you would come to me.

09:50.771 --> 09:52.510
Actually, I did want to see you.

09:53.671 --> 09:54.610
It's nothing much.

09:55.010 --> 09:56.840
I was just curious about what kind of person you are.

09:58.441 --> 09:59.911
But come to think of it,

10:00.911 --> 10:02.380
you've probably been waiting to see me.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.551
So why not let you wait a little longer?

10:08.350 --> 10:09.321
You've matured.

10:09.891 --> 10:11.021
Thank you.

10:11.220 --> 10:12.531
I've been through a lot.

10:13.130 --> 10:14.360
Of course I've matured.

10:17.630 --> 10:20.500
Back then, if you were so composed...

10:20.630 --> 10:22.771
in front of your dad's grave,

10:23.071 --> 10:23.870
I guess...

10:24.071 --> 10:25.911
I wouldn't have been able to do anything to you.

10:28.010 --> 10:29.240
You can't...

10:30.311 --> 10:31.740
do anything to me now either.

10:32.051 --> 10:32.880
Is that so?

10:33.980 --> 10:35.350
If I wanted to,

10:36.051 --> 10:37.120
it would be a piece of cake for me.

10:39.120 --> 10:40.151
I beg you!

10:40.250 --> 10:41.120
Please let my son go!

10:41.191 --> 10:43.120
- You can't ruin him like this! - Get him out of here.

10:43.561 --> 10:45.291
I beg you, please let my child go.

10:45.360 --> 10:46.931
You can't ruin his future!

10:46.990 --> 10:47.931
Get him out of here.

10:47.990 --> 10:49.061
I'm begging you.

10:49.401 --> 10:50.061
I'm begging you.

10:50.130 --> 10:51.661
Let my son go, I'm begging you!

10:51.730 --> 10:53.901
You can't ruin his future like this!

10:54.171 --> 10:56.340
- I'm begging you! - Hey, leave!

10:56.401 --> 10:57.840
I'm begging you!

10:58.201 --> 10:59.171
Let my son go!

10:59.240 --> 11:01.271
You can't ruin his future like this!

11:01.541 --> 11:02.911
I'm begging you!

11:03.010 --> 11:04.240
Please!

11:04.311 --> 11:06.750
You can't ruin my child's future like this!

11:11.521 --> 11:13.120
Excuse me, here's your coffee.

11:29.901 --> 11:31.970
Don't mess with my family again.

11:35.110 --> 11:36.610
This isn't ten years ago.

11:37.210 --> 11:38.641
I'm not that kid from before either.

11:39.311 --> 11:40.480
If you really want to fight,

11:41.110 --> 11:42.380
I'll skin you alive.

11:43.120 --> 11:44.080
That won't be a problem for me.

11:45.691 --> 11:47.421
My dad was hard to deal with, wasn't he?

11:50.490 --> 11:52.090
And I'm tougher than him.

12:02.271 --> 12:03.071
All right.

12:04.701 --> 12:05.811
You and Qin Qin...

12:06.071 --> 12:07.340
should stop seeing each other.

12:12.110 --> 12:13.380
Are you that afraid of me?

12:13.451 --> 12:14.380
I'm not.

12:15.521 --> 12:16.651
You're just not worthy.

12:30.161 --> 12:30.931
Song Yan.

12:31.760 --> 12:32.600
Actually,

12:33.801 --> 12:35.901
I used to admire your dad.

12:36.771 --> 12:38.271
He was an honest man.

12:38.571 --> 12:40.941
But he was too rigid...

12:41.510 --> 12:42.480
and careless in making friends.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.141
And you...

12:46.350 --> 12:47.850
Don't you have any self-respect?

12:48.921 --> 12:50.080
There's such a huge gap...

12:50.580 --> 12:52.090
between our families,

12:52.490 --> 12:54.551
yet you still like Qin Qin.

12:54.990 --> 12:56.291
I wonder...

12:57.620 --> 12:59.431
if you have other intentions.

13:00.791 --> 13:01.990
Or...

13:03.860 --> 13:05.531
if you are just like...

13:06.630 --> 13:07.830
your mom.

13:08.801 --> 13:10.240
We have different values.

13:10.701 --> 13:12.071
There's nothing for us to talk about.

13:13.110 --> 13:14.110
To you,

13:14.641 --> 13:16.010
people are divided into ranks.

13:16.880 --> 13:17.740
To me,

13:18.141 --> 13:19.151
everyone is equal.

13:20.980 --> 13:21.980
In my life,

13:22.720 --> 13:24.181
I've never pandered to anyone...

13:25.151 --> 13:26.720
nor looked down on anyone.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.791
But I look down on you.

13:51.141 --> 13:52.750
What a shame.

13:56.551 --> 13:57.451
Come on, stand up.

13:58.891 --> 13:59.691
Move forward.

14:00.421 --> 14:01.220
Hold it further.

14:04.821 --> 14:05.590
Hold it.

14:08.161 --> 14:09.201
Stop.

14:10.661 --> 14:11.561
Mr. Yang.

14:12.061 --> 14:15.000
We haven't tried the water gun.

14:15.600 --> 14:17.100
Can we have a go?

14:18.171 --> 14:18.941
I don't think so.

14:19.010 --> 14:20.141
You girls aren't strong enough.

14:20.210 --> 14:21.641
The water gun is quite strong.

14:21.740 --> 14:22.941
No, we...

14:23.010 --> 14:24.610
We're strong too.

14:25.510 --> 14:27.051
Just let us try.

14:27.110 --> 14:28.510
We're leaving soon.

14:29.980 --> 14:30.980
Well...

14:31.120 --> 14:32.651
Okay. I'll let you try it.

14:33.720 --> 14:34.620
Take a break.

14:34.891 --> 14:36.321
- Okay. - Take off two sets of uniforms.

14:39.360 --> 14:40.330
- Come with me. - Okay.

14:46.500 --> 14:47.230
Ms. Nan.

14:47.370 --> 14:48.901
- Dr. Xu, take a video for me. - Here.

14:49.271 --> 14:50.041
Okay.

14:50.301 --> 14:51.171
Hold it.

14:51.500 --> 14:52.470
One leg in front.

14:52.771 --> 14:54.210
- One leg in front. Got it? - Okay.

14:54.271 --> 14:55.071
Bend your waist a bit.

14:55.141 --> 14:56.580
You must clamp it. It's really strong.

14:56.641 --> 14:57.340
Okay.

14:57.510 --> 14:58.840
- Turn on the water. - Okay.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.010
Not too much pressure.

15:00.651 --> 15:02.580
Wait. Hold it.

15:02.850 --> 15:04.120
- Pull it back and it'll turn on. - Okay.

15:04.181 --> 15:05.380
- Are you ready? - Ready!

15:05.451 --> 15:06.321
Turn on the water.

15:06.451 --> 15:07.921
- I... - I'm turning it on, Dong Dong.

15:08.990 --> 15:11.191
Three, two, one.

15:19.470 --> 15:20.470
Are you okay?

15:20.671 --> 15:21.730
Are you okay, Dr. Xu?

15:21.801 --> 15:23.071
Dr. Xu, are you okay?

15:25.470 --> 15:26.671
You two, be careful.

15:26.840 --> 15:27.610
Take a look.

15:56.370 --> 15:57.240
Here.

15:57.801 --> 15:59.041
Put on your clothes before coming out.

16:30.041 --> 16:30.740
Hairdryer.

16:30.801 --> 16:32.240
Dry your hair. Don't catch a cold.

16:52.931 --> 16:54.260
Dr. Xu, you're a doctor.

16:54.330 --> 16:55.490
How could you be so clumsy?

16:55.561 --> 16:56.460
That's strange.

16:57.431 --> 16:59.531
Your sleeves are too long and fat.

16:59.600 --> 17:00.500
It makes it difficult.

17:08.041 --> 17:08.811
Sit down.

17:27.290 --> 17:28.990
You're getting my hair tangled.

17:31.201 --> 17:32.260
Do you still need my help?

17:37.240 --> 17:38.300
Why are you laughing?

17:40.310 --> 17:41.310
You look like a ghost.

17:44.141 --> 17:46.010
You're the one who turned me into a ghost.

18:26.820 --> 18:30.591
(Wood Workshop)

18:55.710 --> 18:56.581
Here.

18:57.250 --> 18:58.181
Don't catch a cold.

18:58.250 --> 18:59.250
Take a hot shower.

19:00.320 --> 19:01.790
Uncle and Aunt are here.

19:02.091 --> 19:03.520
What if they come in in the middle of the shower?

19:03.591 --> 19:04.760
I'll get caught.

19:21.141 --> 19:22.310
All right, take a shower.

19:24.540 --> 19:25.510
I'll wait for you outside.

19:40.661 --> 19:41.431
Song Yan.

19:42.861 --> 19:44.331
Where's the hairdryer?

21:18.361 --> 21:19.760
How long have you been a firefighter?

21:21.230 --> 21:21.990
A long time.

21:23.661 --> 21:24.831
That means...

21:25.800 --> 21:26.871
you were in the military.

21:30.240 --> 21:30.970
Of course.

21:31.671 --> 21:32.441
Back then, you said...

21:32.500 --> 21:33.871
you wanted to go to military school.

21:34.141 --> 21:36.141
I failed my college entrance exam the second time.

21:39.881 --> 21:40.681
Don't think too much.

21:41.111 --> 21:42.181
It has nothing to do with you leaving.

21:43.050 --> 21:44.550
I was never good at studying.

21:47.421 --> 21:49.391
But I remember when you repeated the exam,

21:49.891 --> 21:50.720
you improved a lot.

21:51.960 --> 21:52.760
You're mistaken.

21:58.000 --> 21:59.401
All right. It's about dry.

22:08.010 --> 22:09.070
Why do I feel like...

22:09.240 --> 22:10.611
you're not telling me the truth?

22:11.941 --> 22:12.750
Song Yan.

22:13.310 --> 22:14.050
What truth?

22:16.181 --> 22:17.851
I want to know everything about you...

22:18.250 --> 22:19.320
after we broke up.

22:24.760 --> 22:25.891
Can't you tell me?

22:26.960 --> 22:28.361
No, I can't.

22:28.990 --> 22:29.800
Why not?

22:32.671 --> 22:33.831
It's my own business.

22:34.371 --> 22:35.230
It has nothing to do with you.

22:38.841 --> 22:40.040
Nothing to do with me?

22:42.010 --> 22:43.280
Are you being serious?

22:44.141 --> 22:46.151
Then why did I come to the fire station this time?

22:46.810 --> 22:47.611
If that's the case,

22:48.050 --> 22:49.151
you shouldn't have come.

22:51.081 --> 22:52.250
You didn't want me to come?

22:52.581 --> 22:53.790
It has nothing to do with that either.

22:54.820 --> 22:56.191
Then what does it have to do with?

22:56.960 --> 22:58.720
We've missed ten years together.

22:59.191 --> 23:01.161
I want to fill that ten-year gap.

23:12.401 --> 23:13.510
What for, Xu Qin?

23:15.710 --> 23:17.341
A missed time is a missed time.

23:18.710 --> 23:20.151
You can't make up for it...

23:20.210 --> 23:21.550
just because you want to.

23:23.451 --> 23:24.780
Why are you clinging to the past...

23:24.851 --> 23:25.780
and not letting it go?

23:26.720 --> 23:27.720
You said it.

23:28.421 --> 23:29.720
We need time...

23:30.290 --> 23:31.621
to get to know each other.

23:32.391 --> 23:34.290
To understand each other once again.

23:36.230 --> 23:37.460
To see if the person in front of us...

23:39.730 --> 23:41.171
will make our hearts flutter.

23:42.300 --> 23:43.500
If we will like each other.

23:44.841 --> 23:47.010
If we want to be with each other once again.

23:47.841 --> 23:48.941
But the person in front of me...

23:49.010 --> 23:51.411
also came to me after going through the past.

23:52.441 --> 23:53.280
I want to know...

23:53.810 --> 23:56.050
what you have been through for the past ten years.

23:57.151 --> 23:58.681
I want to know about your past.

23:58.780 --> 24:00.750
What's wrong with that?

24:05.191 --> 24:06.230
You can find out.

24:06.990 --> 24:07.790
But Dr. Xu,

24:09.661 --> 24:10.730
right now,

24:12.631 --> 24:13.901
what are we?

24:17.300 --> 24:18.401
Are we friends?

24:19.810 --> 24:20.810
Or lovers?

24:24.210 --> 24:25.740
What kind of identity will you use...

24:27.250 --> 24:28.750
to find out about my past?

24:31.581 --> 24:32.520
Song Yan.

24:34.351 --> 24:36.020
Are you drawing a line between us?

24:37.490 --> 24:38.621
Are you trying to say...

24:39.990 --> 24:41.191
that I've crossed the line...

24:43.230 --> 24:44.161
if we're friends?

24:55.710 --> 24:56.540
I don't know.

24:58.141 --> 25:00.451
I don't know what went wrong with us.

25:03.050 --> 25:05.651
How did we end up at this dead end?

25:06.750 --> 25:07.951
Dead end?

25:13.591 --> 25:14.831
Maybe we shouldn't see each other so often.

25:16.230 --> 25:17.131
If we don't see each other,

25:18.131 --> 25:19.030
we'll keep our distance.

25:21.770 --> 25:22.601
That's good.

25:24.500 --> 25:25.500
You're right.

25:27.641 --> 25:29.210
We should keep our distance.

25:31.941 --> 25:33.310
It's my wishful thinking.

25:35.351 --> 25:36.780
It's all my problem.

25:38.581 --> 25:39.480
I'm sorry.

25:42.320 --> 25:43.691
It'll be over after today.

25:46.230 --> 25:47.161
From now on,

25:48.790 --> 25:50.361
we'll have fewer chances to see each other.

25:51.931 --> 25:52.831
Everything will be okay.

25:53.831 --> 25:54.871
You mean...

25:57.201 --> 25:58.671
You mean after today,

25:59.871 --> 26:00.941
we'll never see each other again?

26:15.951 --> 26:16.960
I see.

26:19.121 --> 26:20.661
So that's what you meant...

26:22.331 --> 26:23.331
when you gave me that gift.

26:29.101 --> 26:30.040
Thank you.

26:33.240 --> 26:34.611
I wish you all the best,

26:36.641 --> 26:37.710
Mr. Song.

27:19.151 --> 27:20.820
Dr. Xu, you just got drenched.

27:20.891 --> 27:21.720
Drink some hot water.

27:21.820 --> 27:23.290
What if you really get sick tomorrow?

27:23.560 --> 27:24.290
It's hot.

27:24.391 --> 27:25.421
- Be careful. - Did you make this?

27:26.691 --> 27:27.391
Drink some.

27:27.530 --> 27:29.460
I have to take care of you on everyone's behalf.

27:30.030 --> 27:30.800
Thank you.

27:31.161 --> 27:32.831
Can I go back to the hospital first?

27:33.131 --> 27:33.871
No way.

27:33.931 --> 27:35.030
You're the team leader.

27:35.570 --> 27:36.901
It's ridiculous if you don't show up.

27:39.300 --> 27:40.270
Drink up.

27:40.371 --> 27:41.671
We have to be there.

27:56.490 --> 27:57.520
I was wondering where you were.

27:57.591 --> 27:58.960
Let's go to the farewell dinner.

28:01.191 --> 28:02.191
What farewell dinner?

28:02.631 --> 28:03.931
Dr. Xu and the others are all there.

28:04.000 --> 28:05.560
They're having a farewell dinner with us.

28:07.000 --> 28:07.770
I have an upset stomach.

28:07.831 --> 28:09.701
Don't be like that. We're waiting for you.

28:09.770 --> 28:11.470
How can you not show up? Let's go.

28:11.601 --> 28:12.401
Hurry up. Come on.

28:12.470 --> 28:13.470
Let's go.

28:15.310 --> 28:16.611
Comrades, let me propose a toast.

28:18.310 --> 28:20.510
We should make a toast...

28:20.710 --> 28:21.851
to the medical staff.

28:21.911 --> 28:23.081
Thank you for your hard work.

28:23.151 --> 28:23.980
Cheers.

28:24.050 --> 28:25.921
- Thank you for your hard work. - Thank you for your hard work.

28:30.391 --> 28:31.921
Well, as the medical team,

28:32.091 --> 28:34.560
we should thank you for taking care of us.

28:34.730 --> 28:35.530
Thank you all.

28:35.661 --> 28:36.701
Don't mention it.

28:36.760 --> 28:37.931
We're on the same team.

28:38.000 --> 28:39.260
We're a family from now on.

28:39.500 --> 28:40.831
- Yes. - Come often.

28:40.901 --> 28:41.901
Ms. Nan, you too.

28:41.970 --> 28:42.931
Sure, we'll come here often.

28:43.000 --> 28:44.371
I'll definitely come often.

28:44.570 --> 28:45.841
I'll bring my son here.

28:46.070 --> 28:46.841
What?

28:47.040 --> 28:48.411
Ms. Bei, you have a son?

28:49.310 --> 28:50.641
- No. - You look so young,

28:50.710 --> 28:52.280
as if you just graduated from medical school.

28:52.341 --> 28:54.151
No, he's my godson.

28:55.181 --> 28:56.681
Well, you still look young.

28:56.780 --> 28:58.081
Ms. Nan, do you have a son?

28:59.250 --> 29:01.520
Pi Pi, you don't have to worry about that.

29:02.220 --> 29:03.460
Dr. Li is so fair.

29:03.520 --> 29:04.421
I'm sure she has many suitors.

29:04.490 --> 29:05.391
I think so too.

29:06.391 --> 29:07.361
Don't be nosy.

29:07.431 --> 29:08.790
I don't.

29:09.230 --> 29:10.901
During every holiday,

29:10.960 --> 29:13.171
my mom arranges blind dates for me.

29:14.030 --> 29:15.201
Forget about me.

29:15.431 --> 29:18.000
You guys aren't worried about this matter, right?

29:18.070 --> 29:19.000
Don't people say...

29:19.070 --> 29:20.810
the most handsome men belong to the country?

29:21.371 --> 29:22.841
Actually, it's strange.

29:23.111 --> 29:24.010
In our station,

29:24.111 --> 29:25.641
those who have a partner are the quiet ones.

29:25.911 --> 29:26.951
Like Jiang Yi,

29:27.010 --> 29:27.980
Ge Zheng,

29:28.351 --> 29:30.081
Yuan Hai, and Kai Liu.

29:30.351 --> 29:31.151
They're all quite quiet.

29:31.351 --> 29:32.050
Right, Ge Zheng?

29:32.121 --> 29:33.320
But you're still so talkative.

29:35.520 --> 29:37.020
If you put it that way,

29:37.421 --> 29:38.421
Chief is the least talkative.

29:38.760 --> 29:39.931
Do you have a girlfriend too?

29:41.661 --> 29:43.161
Don't you know, Dong Dong?

29:43.230 --> 29:45.000
He's madly in love.

29:45.631 --> 29:47.331
He has been waiting for his first love for ten years.

29:52.101 --> 29:53.641
Is that so?

29:55.911 --> 29:57.310
I heard it from Jiang Yi.

29:58.641 --> 29:59.441
Just say it if you want to.

29:59.510 --> 30:00.550
Why did you sell me out?

30:01.381 --> 30:03.520
Chief, you're so romantic.

30:03.720 --> 30:05.050
So there are...

30:05.121 --> 30:06.520
such romantic people in the world.

30:07.151 --> 30:08.290
Tell us, Chief.

30:08.351 --> 30:09.091
Come on.

30:09.151 --> 30:10.020
Jiang Yi was just talking nonsense.

30:10.091 --> 30:11.091
That's not true.

30:11.421 --> 30:12.790
Dig in.

30:12.891 --> 30:13.730
Chief.

30:13.861 --> 30:14.891
What's there to be shy about?

30:14.960 --> 30:15.931
All of us know it.

30:15.990 --> 30:16.800
That's right.

30:17.800 --> 30:19.800
Well, I'll prove it for Jiang Yi.

30:19.970 --> 30:21.371
What Jiang Yi said...

30:21.530 --> 30:22.300
is all true.

30:22.371 --> 30:23.800
All right, stop gossiping.

30:25.371 --> 30:26.570
So where's the girl?

30:29.510 --> 30:30.341
I don't know.

30:31.841 --> 30:32.681
She's abroad.

30:34.550 --> 30:36.250
Does she know you've always liked her...

30:36.310 --> 30:37.480
and been waiting for her?

30:38.050 --> 30:40.191
It doesn't matter if she knows or not.

30:40.550 --> 30:42.091
We won't be together anyway.

30:43.361 --> 30:44.621
So many years have passed.

30:44.820 --> 30:45.621
People change.

30:46.020 --> 30:47.361
Some relationships...

30:47.460 --> 30:48.730
don't have to be forced.

30:49.331 --> 30:50.161
As long as there are memories...

30:50.631 --> 30:51.560
and they're doing well,

30:52.230 --> 30:53.431
that's the best ending.

30:54.431 --> 30:56.570
It's such a shame.

30:56.770 --> 30:57.540
That's right, Chief.

30:57.601 --> 30:58.671
Don't you regret it?

30:58.841 --> 30:59.841
It's life.

31:00.270 --> 31:01.841
How can there be no regrets?

31:02.740 --> 31:03.540
That's right.

31:03.841 --> 31:05.040
I have regrets too.

31:05.111 --> 31:07.250
For example, this joint rescue team...

31:08.181 --> 31:10.451
didn't achieve the goal I expected.

31:10.520 --> 31:11.921
I'm a little disappointed.

31:12.750 --> 31:13.490
How come?

31:13.550 --> 31:15.351
We've learned a lot here.

31:15.421 --> 31:16.091
That's right.

31:16.591 --> 31:17.960
We gained a lot of knowledge.

31:18.020 --> 31:18.820
If we hadn't come,

31:18.891 --> 31:21.161
we wouldn't know that firefighters have to do so much.

31:21.230 --> 31:22.591
That's because the system has changed.

31:23.091 --> 31:23.760
Look.

31:23.831 --> 31:25.060
Fires,

31:25.131 --> 31:26.201
emergency rescue,

31:26.260 --> 31:27.331
social assistance,

31:27.401 --> 31:29.201
and total disaster response...

31:29.401 --> 31:30.171
are now all under our jurisdiction.

31:31.300 --> 31:33.040
Anyway, all I know is after the system has changed,

31:33.101 --> 31:35.040
we are a paramilitary force.

31:35.111 --> 31:36.341
We spend more time on missions.

31:36.641 --> 31:37.681
Yes, and the benefits...

31:37.740 --> 31:38.641
are much better than before.

31:38.710 --> 31:40.210
If it can be improved in the future,

31:40.280 --> 31:41.010
that would be even better.

31:41.081 --> 31:42.010
What benefits?

31:42.081 --> 31:43.421
We're serving the people.

31:43.480 --> 31:44.581
Yes, we're serving the people.

31:44.651 --> 31:46.081
- Yes. - Yes.

31:47.320 --> 31:48.091
Indeed.

31:48.320 --> 31:49.550
No reward is too much...

31:49.691 --> 31:51.320
for what you do.

31:52.121 --> 31:53.331
Restructuring is a great thing.

31:53.631 --> 31:54.361
Yes.

31:54.931 --> 31:57.800
We're more specialized, detailed, and professional.

31:58.060 --> 31:59.970
All of us who are involved...

32:00.371 --> 32:01.770
think it's a good thing.

32:02.831 --> 32:03.601
I hope...

32:03.671 --> 32:05.671
our working environment and system can change too.

32:06.070 --> 32:07.310
Actually, I think...

32:07.510 --> 32:08.841
your job is quite tough too.

32:08.911 --> 32:09.611
Yes.

32:09.671 --> 32:10.681
Compared to yours,

32:10.841 --> 32:12.210
yours is tougher.

32:13.210 --> 32:14.010
Actually,

32:14.111 --> 32:15.780
I really don't like words like heroism,

32:15.851 --> 32:16.621
sentiment,

32:16.681 --> 32:18.351
dedication, and sacrifice.

32:19.480 --> 32:20.591
Words like that...

32:20.921 --> 32:22.921
shouldn't be associated with a particular profession.

32:23.151 --> 32:24.691
A job should be a job itself.

32:30.401 --> 32:31.260
What do you mean?

32:32.401 --> 32:33.601
In society,

32:33.970 --> 32:36.101
no job should be the generator of love.

32:36.171 --> 32:37.601
The public shouldn't ask...

32:37.671 --> 32:39.201
any group of people to devote themselves.

32:39.371 --> 32:40.671
A job is a job.

32:40.911 --> 32:43.040
It can have responsibilities and a mission.

32:43.740 --> 32:45.681
But at its core, it's just a job.

32:46.441 --> 32:48.250
There's no need...

32:48.581 --> 32:49.510
to put a halo on it.

32:50.681 --> 32:51.921
We're all ordinary people.

32:52.550 --> 32:53.990
How much value you create...

32:54.290 --> 32:55.591
is how much you should be rewarded.

32:56.591 --> 32:57.691
Other than that,

32:58.161 --> 32:59.621
don't give your job too much...

32:59.691 --> 33:01.290
other than what it is.

33:01.460 --> 33:02.591
Especially the grand philosophy...

33:02.661 --> 33:03.530
and the grand halo.

33:06.000 --> 33:08.401
Are you denying the halo of our profession?

33:09.500 --> 33:11.171
I just think that things shouldn't be like that.

33:11.901 --> 33:12.901
Like what?

33:17.240 --> 33:18.810
Forget it. You won't understand.

33:24.780 --> 33:25.651
Eat up. Come on.

33:30.691 --> 33:31.691
Do you think...

33:32.391 --> 33:34.290
we're all living in a false dream of heroism?

33:36.361 --> 33:37.131
Actually,

33:37.760 --> 33:39.800
I think this...

33:42.230 --> 33:43.030
Dr. Xu.

33:43.270 --> 33:44.240
Come out for a second.

33:49.441 --> 33:50.280
Chief.

33:50.441 --> 33:52.081
- Dr. Xu. - Dr. Xu...

33:52.510 --> 33:53.480
Why don't I go and check on them?

33:53.550 --> 33:54.210
Sit.

33:55.381 --> 33:57.181
There are so many dishes. Don't waste them.

33:57.881 --> 33:58.720
Don't be nosy.

34:04.290 --> 34:05.161
Let's eat.

34:16.271 --> 34:17.240
Do you think...

34:18.170 --> 34:19.170
those people in there,

34:19.701 --> 34:20.711
your colleagues,

34:21.041 --> 34:21.911
my buddies,

34:22.311 --> 34:23.440
are fools...

34:23.911 --> 34:25.610
who are self-hypnotized by these false dreams of heroism...

34:25.940 --> 34:27.010
all day long?

34:27.150 --> 34:28.251
That's why we chose this profession...

34:28.311 --> 34:29.380
and persisted until now?

34:29.451 --> 34:31.220
You know that's not what I meant.

34:31.280 --> 34:32.650
I know what you meant.

34:34.050 --> 34:35.251
You've always been smart.

34:36.021 --> 34:38.561
You're so smart that everyone is a fool in your eyes.

34:39.561 --> 34:40.561
Including me.

34:40.630 --> 34:42.431
Why are you mad at me?

34:42.791 --> 34:44.561
What I said wasn't wrong.

34:44.630 --> 34:45.501
Indeed.

34:46.001 --> 34:47.831
What you said is very in character of you.

34:47.970 --> 34:48.800
Really.

34:53.711 --> 34:54.510
Xu Qin.

34:55.740 --> 34:57.081
You're still the same as before.

34:58.280 --> 34:59.811
You don't owe anyone anything.

35:00.610 --> 35:02.851
And you won't allow anyone to take anything away from you.

35:03.481 --> 35:05.521
Can't I be objective?

35:06.581 --> 35:07.951
What kind of objective?

35:08.291 --> 35:10.190
There are many kinds of work in this society.

35:10.990 --> 35:12.990
Every profession has its own challenges.

35:13.161 --> 35:14.360
Everyone in their jobs...

35:14.431 --> 35:15.561
has their own difficulties.

35:16.831 --> 35:18.130
Sanitation workers don't have it easy.

35:18.661 --> 35:19.800
Teachers don't have it easy.

35:20.061 --> 35:21.101
Police officers don't have it easy.

35:21.231 --> 35:23.170
Those who guard the borders don't have it easy.

35:23.501 --> 35:25.101
But some special jobs...

35:25.170 --> 35:26.771
that involve public works...

35:26.871 --> 35:28.170
and social care...

35:28.271 --> 35:29.610
are not something

35:31.041 --> 35:32.481
that can be explained with money.

35:35.711 --> 35:37.650
When a profession becomes better...

35:37.981 --> 35:39.181
and improves,

35:39.650 --> 35:41.720
it's because of the effort...

35:42.090 --> 35:43.391
and action of everyone in it.

35:43.561 --> 35:45.121
Not just words.

35:45.360 --> 35:47.391
We face so many things every day.

35:48.961 --> 35:49.990
Matters and feelings.

35:51.001 --> 35:51.831
Xu Qin.

35:55.271 --> 35:57.001
You only see things.

35:58.570 --> 35:59.840
You don't feel.

36:09.851 --> 36:11.280
Do you love your job?

36:15.951 --> 36:17.291
Do you only love your job?

36:17.760 --> 36:18.621
I do.

36:21.030 --> 36:21.990
It's not just me.

36:22.860 --> 36:23.601
So do Jiang Yu,

36:24.001 --> 36:25.601
Yang Chi, and Jiang Yi.

36:26.061 --> 36:28.371
I believe so do Li Nan and Xu Xi.

36:29.970 --> 36:31.001
To you,

36:32.501 --> 36:33.570
it's silly, right?

36:42.451 --> 36:43.550
Do you know?

36:44.150 --> 36:46.251
The words "I am willing"...

36:47.751 --> 36:49.720
can't be bought even with money.

36:53.530 --> 36:55.161
But there are some people...

36:56.331 --> 36:57.431
who are like fools.

36:58.561 --> 37:00.001
They see things...

37:00.470 --> 37:01.630
with their feelings.

37:01.731 --> 37:03.130
(Dare to face dangerous situations, dare to brave the sea of fire)

37:03.570 --> 37:04.900
They're willing to be angels.

37:05.701 --> 37:06.911
They're willing to be heroes.

37:07.940 --> 37:10.141
They're willing to sacrifice themselves for nothing else.

37:12.440 --> 37:14.650
You have no right to look down on them.

37:16.251 --> 37:18.050
I'm not looking down on anyone.

37:18.121 --> 37:19.181
I just want to tell you rationally...

37:19.251 --> 37:20.451
Your rationale is superior...

37:23.150 --> 37:24.121
and cruel.

37:26.021 --> 37:26.820
What you did today...

37:28.130 --> 37:29.360
was highly inappropriate.

37:38.170 --> 37:38.970
Goodbye,

37:40.411 --> 37:41.440
Dr. Xu.

37:54.451 --> 37:55.490
Song Yan.

37:56.150 --> 37:57.490
You misunderstood me.

37:58.690 --> 38:00.161
I just don't want to see you guys...

38:00.220 --> 38:02.530
take such risks for your beliefs.

38:03.630 --> 38:04.800
I don't want your profession...

38:04.860 --> 38:06.601
to be a burden on you.

38:09.470 --> 38:11.101
(Yan City Firefighter)

38:22.510 --> 38:26.050
(Yan City Firefighter, Yanbei Division)

40:52.431 --> 40:53.130
Yang Chi.

40:53.260 --> 40:55.001
Where's the gift you brought for Ms. Xu Xi?

40:55.070 --> 40:56.030
- I know. - Where is it?

40:56.101 --> 40:57.001
Shut up.

40:57.070 --> 40:58.440
Ms. Xu Xi.

40:58.701 --> 41:00.300
This is for you. I know you love it.

41:00.371 --> 41:01.110
So I bought it for you.

41:01.170 --> 41:01.940
Tell me when you run out.

41:02.641 --> 41:03.981
- I'll buy you more. - I don't have a gift for you.

41:04.041 --> 41:05.411
I wish you all the best at work.

41:05.481 --> 41:06.181
Okay.

41:06.240 --> 41:08.251
- Remember to do your laundry. - I will.

41:08.311 --> 41:09.681
- Okay, we'll get going. - Bye.

41:09.751 --> 41:10.880
- Okay. - Instructor.

41:11.021 --> 41:13.150
- Bye. - Do me a favor.

41:13.451 --> 41:14.751
- What is it, Dr. Xu? - Come back often.

41:15.090 --> 41:16.021
About what happened just now,

41:16.190 --> 41:18.220
please apologize to everyone on my behalf.

41:19.090 --> 41:20.760
Sometimes, I don't find the right words to say.

41:20.891 --> 41:21.990
I really didn't mean it.

41:22.360 --> 41:23.331
I know.

41:24.201 --> 41:26.300
The two of you were talking in a rush.

41:26.360 --> 41:27.431
Talked too fast.

41:27.530 --> 41:28.630
Don't take it to heart.

41:29.070 --> 41:30.800
Dr. Xu, don't think too much.

41:30.871 --> 41:32.541
We all know that you didn't mean it.

41:33.240 --> 41:34.711
I know you feel bad for us.

41:35.271 --> 41:36.470
We've known each other for so long.

41:36.541 --> 41:38.081
How can we not know what kind of person you are?

41:38.840 --> 41:40.811
Chief might not be in a good mood today.

41:40.951 --> 41:42.081
Don't take it to heart.

41:43.650 --> 41:44.420
Goodbye.

41:45.650 --> 41:46.451
Take care.

41:53.621 --> 41:54.860
- You don't want to leave? - Don't want to go?

41:54.931 --> 41:56.061
You want to stay?

41:56.360 --> 41:58.130
- Bye. - Bye.

41:59.461 --> 42:00.931
- Bye. - Bye.
